# Model weights are produced inside the image — curl'd (pose, OSNet) or
# exported in the model-export stage (yolo11n-seg.onnx). Without this, the
# final `COPY . .` would layer a developer's local models/ on top of those
# and silently ship whatever happens to be on their disk instead of the
# pinned versions the Dockerfile builds. Also keeps ~30MB of weights out
# of the build context.
models/